message: If you use this software, please cite the version DOI below, or the concept DOI to point at the latest release.
title: "CHAMP-Pipeline: Chat History Archival & Merge Pipeline (Specification and Reference Implementation of the CARTA Framework)"
abstract: "CHAMP-Pipeline is the reference implementation and formal specification of CARTA (Chat Archive Reconstruction & Temporal Access), a platform-agnostic three-phase framework (Ingestion, Normalization, Synthesis) for reconstructing a chat history that has fragmented across two irreconcilable device backups. Synthesis returns the unified history U together with a provenance and reconciliation report Omega. The repository contains the pipeline, a seeded generator for synthetic WhatsApp-format fragments, the experiments reported in the accompanying manuscript, and their committed outputs. All data in the repository are synthetic; no real chat data are included."
